{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_316","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command '$c = Get-Content tests/unit/sensitive-sink-residual-ledger.test.ts -Raw\n$c = $c -replace \"from '\"'\\\\.\\\\./\\\\.\\\\./shared/security/content-provenance'\\\", \\\"from '../../shared/security/content-provenance.ts'\\\"\n# Mutation 1: bogus enforcement symbol\n\"'$c = $c -replace \"exportedSymbol: '\"'assertMessageSecretReadAllowed'\\\", \\\"exportedSymbol: 'assertDefinitelyNotASymbol'\\\"\n# Mutation 2: claim an enforced sink is residual (make residual consult gate)\n\"'$c = $c -replace \"surface: '\"'server-broadcast',\\\", \\\"surface: 'server-broadcast-mutated',\\\"\nSet-Content -Path tests/unit/.tmp-s02-test.ts -Value \"'$c -Encoding UTF8 -NoNewline\n@'\"'\nimport { __run } from \\\"vitest\\\";\nawait import(\\\"./tests/unit/.tmp-s02-test.ts\\\");\nconst r = __run();\nconsole.log(\\\"tests:\\\", r.total, \\\"failures:\\\", r.failures.length);\nfor (const f of r.failures) console.log(\\\"  FAIL:\\\", f);\n'@ | Set-Content -Path .tmp-runner.mjs -Encoding UTF8\nnode .tmp-runner.mjs 2>&1 | Select-String -Pattern \\\"tests:|FAIL:\\\"\nRemove-Item .tmp-runner.mjs, tests/unit/.tmp-s02-test.ts -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\"","aggregated_output":"\r\ntests: 7 failures: 4\r\n  FAIL: toEqual [{\"policyFile\":\"openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/message-secret-read-policy.ts\",\"exportedSymbol\":\"asse\r\nrtDefinitelyNotASymbol\",\"callSite\":\"openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/message-tool.ts\",\"rejectsWith\":\"policy-throw\"}] (\r\nactual=[{\"policyFile\":\"openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/message-secret-read-policy.ts\",\"exportedSymbol\":\"assertMessage\r\nSecretReadAllowed\",\"callSite\":\"openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/message-tool.ts\",\"rejectsWith\":\"policy-throw\"}])\r\n  FAIL: toBe true (actual=false)\r\n  FAIL: toBe true (actual=false)\r\n  FAIL: toContain \"assertDefinitelyNotASymbol\" (actual=\"# S02：敏感 sink 覆盖台账与残余出口守卫\\n\\n日期：2026-10-13（As\r\nia/Shanghai）。包码：S02（TF-0277）。真实 provider 调用：无。性质：**执行化分类核对与残余登记**，非实现报告，非全网强制\r\n声明。\\n\\n## 范围\\n\\n对既有的 `shared/security/content-provenance.ts` 敏感 sink provenance 分类做执行化核对：逐 sink 记\r\n录 enforcement 与 policyFile/导出符号/生产调用点/拒绝形态，来源为权威代码；显式列出尚未接入 cross-context provenance 闸\r\n门的 network-send 残余出口。\\n\\n复用既有 provenance 闸门与分类；**不新建第二套 provenance/taint 引擎、policy 模块、配置\r\n键、路由或依赖**，不改产品默认值/锁/approval 语义。执行化核对由 `tests/unit/sensitive-sink-residual-ledger.test.ts` 解\r\n析工作树钉住。\\n\\n## 强制台账（enforced）\\n\\n下表与 `SENSITIVE_SINK_CLASSIFICATION` 逐字一致。`enforcement` 读作「prove\r\nnance 强制目前接到哪一步」，绝不读作「该 sink 无约束」。\\n\\n| sink | enforcement | policyFile | 导出符号 | 生产调用点 |\r\n 拒绝形态 |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| `secret-read` | narrow | `openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/message-secret-re\r\nad-policy.ts` | `assertMessageSecretReadAllowed` | `openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/message-tool.ts` | policy-throw |\r\n\\n| `network-send` | narrow | `openclaw_runtime/src/infra/outbound/outbound-policy.ts` | `enforceCrossContextPolicy` | \r\n`openclaw_runtime/src/infra/outbound/message-action-runner.ts` | policy-throw |\\n| `external-write` | narrow | `opencla\r\nw_runtime/src/agents/workspace-external-write-provenance-policy.ts` | `wrapToolWithWorkspaceExternalWriteProvenance` | \r\n`openclaw_runtime/src/agents/agent-tools.ts` | policy-throw |\\n| `command-exec` | source-dependent | `openclaw_runtime/\r\nsrc/agents/exec-provenance-policy.ts` | `resolveCommandExecProvenancePolicy` | `openclaw_runtime/src/agents/bash-tools.\r\nexec.ts` | constrain |\\n| `browser-effect` | narrow | `openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/agent-browser-external-access-\r\npolicy.ts` | `resolveAgentBrowserExternalAccessPolicy` | `openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/agent-browser-tool.ts` | ca\r\nll-site-throw |\\n| `browser-effect` | narrow | `openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/agent-browser-external-access-policy.\r\nts` | `resolveAgentBrowserSessionEffectPolicy` | `openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/agent-browser-tool.ts` | call-site-\r\nthrow |\\n| `credential-use` | narrow | `openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/provider-credential-use-policy.ts` | `resolve\r\nProviderCredentialUsePolicy` | `openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/image-generate-tool.ts` | call-site-throw |\\n\\n- `nar\r\nrow`：policy 模块在**一条**生产路径上把 external/unknown provenance 变成拒绝（`policy-throw` 自抛，或 `call-site-throw`\r\n 返回 `allowed:false` 由调用点抛）。是**故意部分**的闸门。\\n- `source-dependent`：`command-exec` 只收紧既有 exec securi\r\nty/ask floor（`constrain`），**从不单独拒绝**；它是 `resolveCommandExecProvenancePolicy` 对已有决策的约束，不是拒绝。\\n\r\n- 无 sink 为 `classification-only`：六个 sink 的 `enforcedAt` 均非空。`classification-only` 表示「本仓库尚无路径查询 pr\r\novenance 来限制该 sink」，是**没有强制**，不是「已完成」。\\n\\n## 残余出口（residual network-send）\\n\\n以下 network-send\r\n 网络出口**未接入** cross-context provenance 闸门（`isExternalOrUnknownProvenance` / `provenanceStatus`）。它们是 resid\r\nual，**不是无风险**：各自有独立的授权（allowlist、trust 校验、scope guard 等），但**没有一条**查询 `ContentProvenance` \r\n来限制出站，故均不得被表述为全网强制。\\n\\n| residual surface | 文件 | 导出符号 |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| outbound-send-servic\r\ne | `openclaw_runtime/src/infra/outbound/outbound-send-service.ts` | `executeSendAction`、`executePollAction` |\\n| mess\r\nage-action-dispatch | `openclaw_runtime/src/channels/plugins/message-action-dispatch.ts` | `dispatchChannelMessageActio\r\nn` |\\n| cli-runtime-outbound | `openclaw_runtime/src/gateway/cli-runtime/send-runtime/channel-outbound-send.ts` | `crea\r\nteChannelOutboundRuntimeSend` |\\n| sessions-send-policy | `openclaw_runtime/src/sessions/send-policy.ts` | `resolveSend\r\nPolicy` |\\n| auto-reply-send-policy | `openclaw_runtime/src/auto-reply/send-policy.ts` | `parseSendPolicyCommand` |\\n| \r\nserver-broadcast | `openclaw_runtime/src/gateway/server-broadcast.ts` | `createGatewayBroadcaster` |\\n\\n对照：`network-\r\nsend` sink 的 `narrow` 点只覆盖 agent message tool 触发的 cross-context 出站（`enforceCrossContextPolicy`）。上表其余出\r\n口（CLI、system delivery、broadcast、plugin dispatch、session policy）**仍属显式残余范围**——单条路径通过**不是**全网强\r\n制。\\n\\n## 边界声明（not whole-network enforcement）\\n\\n- 本台账**不是全网强制**：它记录每条已接闸门路径与尚未接闸门的 \r\nresidual 出口，仅此而已。\\n- 单条生产路径通过 → **不得**推导为全网强制。\\n- `classification-only` → **不得**推导为全网\r\n强制（它是无强制，不是已覆盖）。\\n- 既有 drift guard 语义仍成立：登记点必须真实存在且被生产调用点引用；导入 `isExternal\r\nOrUnknownProvenance` / `provenanceStatus` 的模块构成 provenance 闸门面，**新增闸门会被反向扫描要求登记**；residual 出口\r\n若悄悄获得闸门，测试会失败并要求其改列为 enforced。\\n\\n## 实测（本地，无真实 provider）\\n\\n- `tests/unit/sensitive-sink\r\n-residual-ledger.test.ts`：分类键与 `SENSITIVE_SINK_KINDS` 一致；enforced 镜像与 `SENSITIVE_SINK_CLASSIFICATION` 一一对\r\n应；逐点解析 policyFile 导出符号存在、policy 模块确实查询 provenance 闸门、callSite 确实引用符号；`command-exec` 的 `co\r\nnstrain` 未被表述为拒绝；六个 residual 出口文件存在、导出符号存在、且**确实未查询** provenance 闸门；反向扫描 `openclaw\r\n_runtime/src` 无未登记闸门消费者；台账文本含全部 residual/enforced 路径且含「不是全网强制」声明。\\n- 既有 `tests/unit/e\r\nxternal-content-provenance.test.ts` 仍固定同名 sink 的 `narrow`/`source-dependent` 状态，无回归。\\n\\n## 边界与残余\\n\\n-\r\n 本包不改任何产品代码（`content-provenance.ts` 仅作为权威来源被读取并逐字核对，未修改）。\\n- 不改产品默认值/锁/approval\r\n，不新建第二套 engine。\\n- 已复核 README.md / README.zh-CN.md / README.ja-JP.md / README.ru-RU.md：本包为分类台账与测试\r\n钉住，无用户可见接口变化，故不改。\\n- 非真人证据：证据 `driven_by: agent`；不声称真人操作、verdict 或数据。\")\r\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
